List games

Usage: zaun list [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --json        Machine-readable output
  -v, --verbose...  Increase log verbosity (-v debug, -vv trace)
      --running     Only running games
      --tag <TAG>   Only games with this tag
  -h, --help        Print help
